{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JON","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"约拿书","commonName":"约拿书","title":"约拿书","order":32,"numberOfChapters":4,"sha256":"029ca4d2eb1b1c2cc0e47bf2fbd452a8a1c4e1a147cd781bd41c94fced3e200a","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JON/1.json","lastChapterNumber":4,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JON/4.json","totalNumberOfVerses":48},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["约拿的祷告"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["约拿在鱼腹中向他的上帝耶和华祷告说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"“耶和华啊，我遭遇患难的时候向你求告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你就应允我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在阴间的深处呼求你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你也垂听我的声音。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你把我抛进深海，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"抛进大洋的腹地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"洋流围困我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的巨浪洪涛淹没我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我心想，我从你面前被赶走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我还要再瞻仰你的圣殿。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"波涛吞噬我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"深海围困我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"海草缠绕着我的头。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我下沉到山的根基，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地的门闩把我永远关住；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，我的上帝耶和华啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你却把我的性命从深坑中拯救出来。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的生命渐渐消逝的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我就想起了耶和华。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的祷告进入你的圣殿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"达到你面前。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那些信奉虚无神明的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"背弃了怜爱他们的上帝","poem":1},{"noteId":0},{"text":"，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我要用感谢的声音向你献祭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必还我许的愿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为救恩来自耶和华。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"于是，耶和华命令那条鱼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"鱼就把约拿吐到陆地上。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"“背弃了怜爱他们的上帝”或译“背弃了他们对上帝的忠诚”。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":8}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JON/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JON/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JON/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}